2026-08-24 @ 15:35 - [Docs - .config.example notes that a populated APMIA_BROWSER_SNIPPET was most likely set by bpa-demo-axa-app.sh]:
  User asked for a comment clarifying the provenance of a populated
  APMIA_BROWSER_SNIPPET value, so a future reader of .config.example
  isn't left guessing where it came from. Added a comment block above
  the variable pointing at dxo2-scripts/bpa-demo-axa-app.sh's `create`
  command and dxo2-scripts/README.md's AXA section, and reiterating
  that the snippet is safe to commit (a client-side tag, not a secret).
  Verified the script's patch logic doesn't disturb it: re-ran
  bpa-demo-axa-app.sh create and confirmed via git diff that only the
  APMIA_BROWSER_SNIPPET= value line changed, since the patch regex is
  anchored to that literal line prefix and never touches `#` comment
  lines above it.

