2026-08-21 @ 16:40 - [Feat - templated and created three more BPA application dashboards from console exports]:
  User exported three pre-existing BPA-related dashboards by hand from
  the DX O2 console (Dashboards -> JSON Model -> Export) into
  jm-dashboards/bpa/ and asked for them to be analyzed, given human-
  readable panel descriptions, and created in the "BPA-Demo" folder the
  same way bpa-demo-agent-health-dashboard.sh's dashboard already is.
  Analysis: unlike every other dashboard/alert/SLI in this project, all
  three query the AIOps_BPAMetadata Grafana datasource directly against
  the BPA WebServer Extension's raw captured-transaction Elasticsearch
  index (ao_aum_captured_data_2*) -- one document per HTTP
  request/response mod_caplugin actually captured (app_alias, bt_name,
  res_status, server_time, res_size/req_size, req_metadata_client_ip/
  req_metadata_server_ip, req_header_x_forwarded_for, reqUrl.keyword,
  transaction_id), not a NASS metric-catalog aggregate. Confirmed by
  reading each panel's raw targets[].metrics/bucketAggs JSON, not
  guessed from titles.
  Added dxo2-scripts/templates/bpa-demo-{application-overview,
  application-drilldown,transaction-details-drilldown}-dashboard.json:
  - id/uid/version/iteration/gnetId stripped (fresh import mints its
    own), matching bpa-demo-agent-health-dashboard.sh's convention.
  - Titles prefixed "BPA-Demo <middle dot> " to match the folder's
    existing dashboard; fixed a double-space typo in the original
    "Transaction Details  Drilldown" title.
  - tags set to ["bpa-demo", "BPA"] -- keeps each dashboard's own
    built-in "BPA"-tag cross-link dropdown working, while matching this
    project's tagging convention.
  - A human-readable description (Grafana's "i" hover icon) added to
    every data panel that lacked one:
    * BPA-Demo Application Overview: Success Rate, Average Response
      Time heatmap, Response Count, and 3 Performance Overview tables
      (dashboard range / fixed 24h / fixed 7d).
    * BPA-Demo Application Drilldown: Server Errors, ART by Server IP,
      Unique/Forwarded Client IPs, Performance Overview (BT-level) +
      Details (URL-level).
    * BPA-Demo Transaction Details Drilldown: Transaction Details,
      Total Filtered Transactions stat, raw-captured-document table,
      Filtered Transaction List.
  Added dxo2-scripts/bpa-demo-application-dashboards.sh: same
  create/check/delete shape and dashboard-import/export-edit-update
  upsert pattern as bpa-demo-agent-health-dashboard.sh, array-driven
  over all three dashboards in one script instead of one script per
  dashboard. No new CLI landmines beyond the ones that script's header
  comment already documents (dashboardExportFile= param name, broken
  overwrite=true upsert, dashboard-update not resolving a numeric id
  from a bare uid on this build).
  Verified live: `create` imported all three into the "BPA-Demo" folder
  with the expected panel counts/types/titles (`check` output matches
  the original exports exactly); re-running `create` upserted all three
  in place by uid (version 1 -> 2, no duplicates); a post-upsert
  dashboard-export confirmed tags, templating, and every panel's
  description survived the export -> edit -> update round-trip.
  Documented in dxo2-scripts/README.md (new Scripts row + Dashboards
  subsection) and CLAUDE.md's dxo2-scripts narrative.

