    app/src/templates/layout.php and every app/src/pages/*.php file
    (shop, product, basket, checkout, order, login, logout, admin) plus
    app/src/lib/auth.php and app/src/usecases/locked.php to the
    index.php?page=<slug> form. shop.php's GET filter form needed a
    hidden <input name="page" value="shop"> (not just a query string in
    the action URL) since browsers discard a GET form's action-URL query
    string and rebuild it from the form fields alone; POST forms don't
    have this problem since the action URL's query string is preserved
    as-is for a POST request.
