2026-07-10 @ 18:20 - [Feat - package-helm-bundle.sh for deploying Helm from a host without the full repo]:
  User asked for a script producing all files needed to deploy via Helm,
  assuming images are already pushed from a bastion host.
  Added build-scripts/package-helm-bundle.sh: stages helm/php-demo/,
  build-scripts/deploy.sh, .config.example, and a generated README.txt
  into a temp directory, dereferencing every symlink with `cp -rL`
  (not just files/vhost.conf specifically) before tarring into
