  confirmed vhost.conf is a real file with identical content to the
  source, confirmed `helm lint` passes clean against the standalone
  chart with no symlink warning, and confirmed deploy.sh's own
  SCRIPT_DIR-relative path resolution finds the chart correctly from
  the bundle's preserved build-scripts/ + helm/ sibling layout.
  Files changed: build-scripts/package-helm-bundle.sh (new), .gitignore
