  build-scripts/compose.sh and build-scripts/deploy.sh both defaulted every
  APMIA identity var (APMIA_AGENT_NAME, APMIA_APP_NAME, APMIA_HOST_NAME,
  APMIA_PROCESS_NAME, APMIA_PHP_AGENT_NAME, APMIA_WEB_AGENT_NAME) to the
