  DEPLOYMENT_POSTFIX (left empty in .config.example; compose.sh defaults it
  to "docker", deploy.sh defaults it to "k8s"). Both scripts now compute
  deployment_id="${DEPLOYMENT_NAME}-${DEPLOYMENT_POSTFIX}" and use it as the
  fallback for all six identity vars -- any one can still be set explicitly
  to override just that agent while the rest share the default.
  Files changed: .config.example (new Deployment identity section + the six
  identity vars now shown explicitly, left empty), build-scripts/compose.sh
