  updated to "bpa-demo-k8s" for a bare `helm install` without deploy.sh),
  docker-compose.yml (inline ${VAR:-default} fallback literals updated to
  "bpa-demo-docker" -- only reachable if docker compose is invoked directly,
  bypassing compose.sh's own exports), CLAUDE.md (new "Deployment identity"
  section documenting the bug and fix).
