  APMIA_PHP_AGENT_NAME/APMIA_WEB_AGENT_NAME fields. This sandbox's own local
  .config (Docker Compose) updated to DEPLOYMENT_POSTFIX="docker" and the six
  identity vars cleared to pick up the shared default -- not committed
