  New dxo2-scripts/bpa-demo-agent-alerts.sh: create|check|delete for 10
  Metric Groupings + Alerts attached to the existing "BPA-Demo" Management
  Module. Infrastructure Agent (DB Monitor extension): DB Availability Down
  (LESS_THAN 1/1), DB Connection Refusals (GREATER_THAN 0/5), DB Connection
  Pool Pressure (GREATER_THAN 80/95), DB Buffer Pool Cache Degraded
  (LESS_THAN 95/90), DB Slow Query Rate Rising (GREATER_THAN 1/5). PHP
  probe agent: App Response Time High (GREATER_THAN 100/250 -- reuses
  bpa-demo-management-module.sh's measured thresholds), App Error Rate
