2026-07-06 @ 15:00 - [Feat - Scripted DX O2 Management Module/Alert for the trouble use case]:
  Investigated which of the three demo use cases (trouble, empty_basket,
  locked) have a real, currently-observable APM signal to alert on. Only
  trouble does: usecases/trouble.php's 5000 sequential DB reads/request
  measurably spikes response time. empty_basket and locked do not --
  confirmed by reading login.php/usecases/locked.php (neither sets an HTTP
