2026-06-30 @ 10:00 - [Feat – Set browser agent maxSearchingLength for reliable script injection]:
  src/apache-php/entrypoint.sh: always patch
  wily_php_agent.enable.browseragent.snippet.maxSearchingLength=32768 in the
  PHP probe INI.  The <head> tag appears at byte 33 in every response, but the
  inline CSS block inside <head> is 13.8 KB, placing </head>/<body> at byte
  ~13 861.  32 768 (32 KB) gives 2x headroom over the fallback injection point
  and future-proofs the setting against CSS growth.  Without this, the probe
  relies on the installer INI default (typically 16 KB), which is only ~2 KB
  above the current requirement.
  CLAUDE.md: updated PHP probe injection section to document the setting.

