2026-06-19 @ 18:00 - [Feat – limit PHP probe log display to 2 files per naming group on ?page=dxo2]:
  The wily_php_agent probe generates two log file patterns:
    Group A: wily_php_agent_<pid>.log            (active per-process log)
    Group B: wily_php_agent_<pid>-<ts>_N.log     (rolled log with sequence suffix)
  Previously all matching files were shown, which could flood the page.
  Now only the 2 most recent files per group are collected and displayed.

  app/src/pages/dxo2.php:
  - Replaced the flat glob loop in section 6 with a two-group regex split:
    Group A matched by absence of hyphen-timestamp-sequence pattern;
    Group B matched by /wily_php_agent_\d+-\d+_\d+\.log$/.
    Each group is sorted ascending and sliced to the last 2 entries.
  - Updated PHP Probe Logs card subtitle to reflect the 2-per-group limit.

  Files changed: app/src/pages/dxo2.php, CHANGELOG

