2026-06-19 @ 13:00 - [Fix – BTListener log not visible on ?page=dxo2]:
  Root cause: /opt/btlistener/logs/ is local to the dx-o2-agent container.
  The apache-php container mounts only /opt/apmia (the shared emptyDir /
  named volume) and cannot access any path outside it.  The BTL log file
  therefore did not exist from PHP's perspective, causing tail_file() to
  return an empty string and the "No log files found" notice to appear.

  Fix: in src/dx-o2-agents/entrypoint.sh, before starting BTL, replace
  /opt/btlistener/logs/ with a symlink to /opt/apmia/logs/:
    rm -rf "${BTL_HOME}/logs"
    ln -sf "${APMIA_HOME}/logs" "${BTL_HOME}/logs"
  BTL continues to write BTListener.log to its expected path; the symlink
  transparently redirects writes into the shared volume, making the file
  readable from the apache-php container as /opt/apmia/logs/BTListener.log.

  app/src/pages/dxo2.php:
  - BTL_LOG_PATH updated from /opt/btlistener/logs/BTListener.log to
    /opt/apmia/logs/BTListener.log (new location via symlink redirect).
  - APMIA logs glob now skips BTListener.log (continue if basename matches)
    to prevent it appearing twice — once in the APMIA logs card and once in
    the dedicated BTListener log card.

  CLAUDE.md: documented the symlink redirect in the DX O2 sidecar section
  and updated the ?page=dxo2 log tails description.

  Files changed:
  - src/dx-o2-agents/entrypoint.sh
  - app/src/pages/dxo2.php
  - CLAUDE.md

